  "content_id": "16136230",
  "title": "Monero XMR Network Fees",
  "description": "Monero (XMR) Network – Private and Secure\nMonero is the leading privacy coin, with every transaction shielded to protect sender, receiver,...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ32G55KC9RFQ46YC3F1EJ3\">Monero (XMR) Network – Private and Secure</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Monero is the leading privacy coin, with every transaction shielded to protect sender, receiver, and amount details.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ32G5552FDPEYH08CTJK8T\">How Monero Fees Work</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Fees depend on:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Transaction size</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Privacy level</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Network congestion</b><br>Fees are paid in <b>XMR</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge calculates fees based on Monero’s real-time blockchain status.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ32G555DBEMGBA9BDH07DE\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Prioritize speed</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Balanced for most users</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Cheaper, slower</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Manually adjust advanced settings</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ32G551VE8EDHZKE0DB0EG\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Sending Monero usually costs <b>$0.02 to $0.20 USD</b>, depending on privacy complexity.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ32G55XXF8YZ5426B2PAJZ\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Monero’s privacy comes with slightly higher transaction data, but Edge Wallet simplifies fee choices while keeping your privacy intact.</p><hr>",
